{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d3527ac83386f643d6e2c1774a18a354abea5da343e3b888c5674e26959bff3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:723dd52c9bcb6206e1c5e366e77dd2d087c6c34856831fe3ed526dac499be4d5",
      "text": "吃我一拳……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6393328656690e2c400d1d32f8a21773fadb5947654035d1f35c51280fd101",
      "text": "嘿哟……\n不管打多少次，那种拳头都是打不中我的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2938f61168349546127e7b6a9e7e3b3ce6e881010fb409455be7532ac2ae19f6",
      "text": "哈啊……哈啊……\n少在那闪来闪去的。这次看招……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61421c11b9ca44a8753ede88e009d5b47758835896a546bf98c5029aa10f1300",
      "text": "你们几个，还没看清实力差距吗？\n……看看这盒子里面的甜甜圈吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a81eb1ca15a9d80dadbb423ea7f6c38411403ef676a6687844b1b3a96d4961c",
      "text": "瞧啊……就像什么事都没发生一样安安稳稳地躺着呢。\n这代表着什么，你们明白吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f881142f526180a2066e4792b96fa987291a8ded1ab1b82d9324b53af9079ae",
      "text": "（好、好厉害！明明有那么大动作，\n甜甜圈居然还排得整整齐齐……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5226dff5eadc1982bc465d9483072e7a1f99c68af3ea23baf7e02516348fb838",
      "text": "可恶！\n下次再碰到给我记住了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a57235561e9c8c8fd512f9f63f684e57a9259f16472c64a8e491f708a3e17f7e",
      "text": "唉，被奇怪的家伙纠缠上了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49b25b51c484dcd4bb764cd37fe7682327c83970384caa5e5c0efc01eda21e32",
      "text": "春名先生才没事吧？\n我没能帮上忙，真对不起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a77e34188801e56536c3236554b4843f852f8636fffd10687729faa9cbdc7b1",
      "text": "没有啦，我这边才不好意思呢。我好像\n挺扎眼的，偶尔就会被人找碴打架。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a0d8aa05fc91907acee5b232fd54d3bdf77df77ea5c3dfa43c47b3b92b8fbe",
      "text": "虽说像刚才那样随便应付应付就行了，\n但今天把你给卷进来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcc4adaa2875a5a337e9e0226500ebac9ed1aba9e33ca515af04a9f9c72b43e2",
      "text": "我也必须像春名先生那样，\n变得能轻松应付他们才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659cef7a529d43c2d116c38ce36de69f89ffb9b42460b3cf36a2df906e550c47",
      "text": "哎呀～，咱们这里打架厉害的家伙多的是，\n制作人不用连这个都变强啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb70553358c55c41b7cc7fa1b581e1547607972c5d5a30c76f5c63d8d831fca",
      "text": "像是神速一魂，还有THE 虎牙道的那两个人。\n虽然年龄和我差不多，但绝对超级强啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
